// error: guide_guardrail.pts:12:5 - error PTS3001: `sum` is declared outside this parallel body, which runs on several threads at once, so assigning it here would race; combine the results with `.par.reduce` or `.par.sum`, or use an `Atomic` from pts:sync
// error: guide_guardrail.pts:18:24 - error PTS3001: `last` is declared outside this parallel body, which runs on several threads at once, so assigning it here would race; combine the results with `.par.reduce` or `.par.sum`, or use an `Atomic` from pts:sync
